<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  Operator copy for the proof trim editor.

  Farm language only, per the user-facing copy firewall: no pipeline mechanics (compression,
  overlay, encode, stitch as a verb the operator performs) and no internal vocabulary. The
  operator is told what they are doing to the video, never how the app processes it.

  Temporary exception to backend-owned labels: these live in the module because the editor is
  behind an off-by-default flag and has no backend contract yet. Moving them into the bootstrap
  contract, and adding hi/kn/te translations, is tracked as follow-up before the flag is enabled
  for any tenant.
-->
